== two regions, each a pg_auto_failover group: the primary of us-west is killed ==
   us-east primary: us-east-a, us-west primary: us-west-a
-- slots on each primary, and what its standbys hold
   us-east-a: sub_us_west_from_us_east|logical|t
   us-east-a: synchronized_standby_slots = pgautofailover_standby_2,pgautofailover_standby_3
   us-west-a: sub_us_east_from_us_west|logical|t
   us-west-a: synchronized_standby_slots = pgautofailover_standby_2,pgautofailover_standby_3
   us-east-b: synced copy of the failover slot: t (after 40s)
   us-east-c: synced copy of the failover slot: t (after 1s)
   us-west-b: synced copy of the failover slot: t (after 24s)
   us-west-c: synced copy of the failover slot: t (after 1s)
-- steady state: us-east holds 384 own rows and 384 from us-west
-- t0=1793101311.530299877: docker kill us-west-a
   new primary of us-west: us-west-c, 51.4 s after t0
-- waiting for both regions to converge
   converged: 1 after 1s  (us-east rows on us-east/us-west: 3593/3593, us-west rows: 2104/2104)

